sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Signal or deadline
  participant R as Ravel CLI
  participant E as LLM endpoint
  participant H as Harness run group
  participant W as Policy worker
  S->>R: INT, TERM, HUP or the end of the deadline
  R->>R: latch the cause — a later signal does not replace it
  alt an LLM call is in flight
    R--xE: drop the Rig request, close the connection
    Note over E: work that the provider already accepted may finish and be billed
  else a harness run is in progress
    R->>H: stop request: TERM
    H-->>R: exit, or the kill-grace ends
    R->>H: KILL the survivors in the group
    R->>R: reap the child, check that the group is gone
  end
  R->>W: KILL
  R->>R: reap the worker, remove the private directories
  R-->>S: refuse with 124, or with 128 plus the signal, then raise it again
